    "members": "The members who voted that way, by name.",
    "view": "A judgment or observation, as a clause.",
    "action": "What the body did or should do, in a verb phrase.",
    "subject": "What was assessed.",
    "judgment": "How it was assessed, such as uncertain.",
    "body": "The body meeting, such as the Committee or the Council.",
    "reason": "Why the member dissented.",
